<section class="wander-3d-shell" data-wander-3d>
  <div class="wander-3d-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Pixel wander room · interactive space</p>
    <h2>欢迎来到会变化的像素工作室。</h2>
    <p>这里没有导航栏。拖动镜头看看，靠近一件物品，选择你想先发现的那条支线。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wander-3d-stage">
    <canvas data-wander-canvas aria-label="漫游房间 3D 场景"></canvas>
    <div class="wander-3d-hint" data-room-hint>拖动看看 · 点击物件开始漫游</div>
    <div class="wander-3d-memory" aria-live="polite"><span data-room-memory></span><span data-room-progress></span></div>
    <div class="wander-3d-fallback" data-wander-fallback>
      <span>3D 场景加载失败</span>
      <a href="/wander/" class="underline">继续使用房间入口</a>
    </div>
    <div class="wander-3d-controls" aria-label="房间入口">
      <button type="button" data-room-camera="center" aria-pressed="true">回到房间</button>
      <button type="button" data-room-camera="anime" aria-pressed="false">番剧书架</button>
      <button type="button" data-room-camera="photo" aria-pressed="false">照片墙</button>
      <button type="button" data-room-camera="notes" aria-pressed="false">支线随笔</button>
      <button type="button" data-room-camera="memo" aria-pressed="false">小木电台</button>
    </div>
    <a href="/wander/" class="wander-3d-enter" data-room-enter>逛一圈 →</a>
    <button type="button" class="wander-3d-skip" data-wander-3d-skip>使用文字目录</button>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
